  "changelog": "Initial release of geoskill-irrigation-efficiency:\n\n- Calculates net irrigation water demand from crop evapotranspiration and effective precipitation.\n- Supports both fixed coefficient and USDA-SCS methods for effective precipitation calculation.\n- Assesses spatial irrigation efficiency and water deficit using raster data.\n- Runs fully offline, including an optional synthetic data mode for testing.\n- Outputs GeoTIFF rasters and summary JSON reports for irrigation demand, efficiency, and deficit.",
